{'author': 'Alex Wilms',
 'description': 'Special agent for OPNsense firewalls via the REST API. '
                'Monitors firmware/update status, all services (one service '
                'per OPNsense service, auto-discovered), system status, '
                'uptime, load, memory, swap, filesystem usage and SMART disk '
                'health when the os-smart plugin is installed: health '
                'self-assessment, temperature and SSD life remaining. '
                'Additionally gateway status (dpinger RTT/loss), WireGuard '
                'peers (handshake age, traffic), Kea/Dnsmasq DHCPv4 pool '
                'usage, temperature sensors and a throttled package '
                'vulnerability audit (pkg audit) with visible result age. All '
                'disks reported by os-smart are collected; unwanted ones can '
                'be excluded via a Checkmk disabled-services rule. '
                'Configurable HTTPS port (default 8443) and optional TLS '
                'certificate check bypass for self-signed certificates.',
 'download_url': 'https://github.com/Gulaschcowboy/checkmk_extensions',
